# This repository is PUBLIC, and the client folders sit beside the code. Each one
# holds citizen card scans, bank statements, payslips and tax returns for a real
# person. So nothing is tracked unless it is named here: a client folder added in
# future is ignored because it was never allowed, not because someone remembered
# to add it. Allow code only, and never a directory that holds client documents.
/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/Kova Finance.ps1
!/organize_kova.py
!/webapp/
!/kova-app/

# Secrets and the local database, inside an allowed directory
webapp/kova.db
webapp/.secret_key

# Build artifacts, inside an allowed directory
kova-app/node_modules/
kova-app/android/
kova-app/ios/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Generated at the project root. Already covered by the rule above; listed so the
# reason they are absent is obvious.
# organize_plan.json, claude_review.json, claude_categorizations.json, .ocr_cache.sqlite
